{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">2002 AMC 12P #15</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">2002 AMC 10P #17</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> red marbles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> black marbles in a box. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d86c02b2499bd6e34e215d081a9b6e0cebc76fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> be the probability that two marbles drawn at random from the box are the same color, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/5/74505c8c90cbac5d5ca5e984a5dbb0be2d3f2535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> be the probability that they are different colors. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/d/16d3fbc8d3fb9685af4b44cab9465244d02ebad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|P_s-P_d|.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b723f72c33eef6a2336ce44c46f7c83672b2ee4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }0 \\qquad \\text{(B) }\\frac{1}{2002} \\qquad \\text{(C) }\\frac{1}{2001} \\qquad \\text{(D) }\\frac {2}{2001} \\qquad \\text{(E) }\\frac{1}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"458\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d86c02b2499bd6e34e215d081a9b6e0cebc76fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" />. Note that whatever color we choose on our first marble, there are exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7e2da81334aad3aeeb09706fed72248196613b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2001$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> marbles remaining that match that color. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b49fa5426f1116db63abec8e09f4e5035bb77d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_s = \\frac {1000}{2001}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Now we find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/5/74505c8c90cbac5d5ca5e984a5dbb0be2d3f2535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" />. Again, the actual color of the first marble does not matter, since there are always exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7e2da81334aad3aeeb09706fed72248196613b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2001$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> marbles remaining that don't match that color. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/b/15b71cbfc7d02142b39a83c5a5ef18bd21ac51ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_d = \\frac{1001}{2001}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/0/6e0640ba52cb25cdf41ebf8225c2c73f53aed086.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|P_s - P_d|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" /> is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740969e56464393e682361ba716a5c97ac85cf85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {|1000-1001|}{2001} = \\boxed {\\text{(C) }\\frac{1}{2001}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"217\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~Minor edits from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Astro2010\" title=\"User:Astro2010\">Astro2010</a>~\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"200